@* What Loopsmith doesn't support (a raid's, an activity's or a retired season's mod, ADRs D35), on its square: a small grey
   ✕ in the lower-right corner, where ⊘ goes; the square itself is drawn faded and in grey (.icon-tile.ignored). *@
<span class="ignored-mark" title="@Title" data-testid="ignored-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="2.5" y1="2.5" x2="7.5" y2="7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><line x1="2.5" y1="7.5" x2="7.5" y2="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span>

@code {
    /// <summary>What the mark means, as its tooltip says it.</summary>
    public const string Title = "Not supported: raid, activity and seasonal mods are ignored.";
}
